{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/geist-the-sin-eaters/58017-the-bound-and-angels-gmc-ish-question","id":58017,"title":"The Bound and angels (GMC-ish question)","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Geist: The Sin-Eaters"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-01-26T04:08:32-08:00","id":58017,"title":"The Bound and angels (GMC-ish question)","content":"Can the Bound see the angels of the the God-Machine while said angels are in twilight or is it like the bound and spirits? (I've always ran The Bound as seeing spirits as &quot;fuzzy&quot; and unable to hear them with any clarity less the spirit is a &quot;death spirit&quot;)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1991-fallenxanderel","name":"FallenXanderel","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"25"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-26T10:09:43-08:00","id":58159,"title":"","content":"I would say that it is something similar to spirits, though angels whose purpose involves ghosts or the Underworld might be perceivable. I wonder, actually, if there is any intentional connection between the animal psychopomps in the Great Below and the Incarnation of the same name.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1423-espritdecalmar","name":"espritdecalmar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1423_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"941"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-26T10:22:58-08:00","id":58168,"title":"","content":"The RAW is that each type of ephemeral being is made up of a different kind of essence, and so are not able to interact with one another. Ghosts, Spirits, and Angels (and all the others) all exist in different &quot;frequencies&quot;. The phrasing of GMC was fairly convincing - they are constructed out of different types of... resonance which don't overlap much with each other; in their intangible state, they have no way to sense or interact with each other. Characters which are able to see into Twilight only do so to one frequency, which their abilities describe. Sin-Eaters only see the ghostly spectrum. While manifested, of course, they are material to everything.<br /> <br /> So the short of it is that they wouldn't see angels in Twilight - or, they would see angels with the same rules that they see spirits, however your game handles that.<br /> <br /> That being said, things should be fudged in order to make it a good story. An enemy they can't see or understand can be nice and scary, as long as they find a way to oppose them in a not-frustrating manner. Being haunted by blurry people that don't work like ghosts they can Almost make out the details of is also good. Also, I'm partial to saying that if an ability lets you go into Twilight (like Reverse Possession), their senses open up to the full of Twilight: ie, they can normally only see ghosts, but when they shift into Twilight, they can see all types of ephemeral being. YMMV, of course.<br /> <br /> Hope that's helpful,<br /> Seraph Kitty","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">Second Chance for<br /> <img class=\"bbcode-attachment js-need-data-att-update\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=709\" data-tempid=\"temp_709_1572548741915_354\" /><br /> A Beautiful Madness</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/425-seraph-kitty","name":"Seraph Kitty","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar425_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"394"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-26T12:30:18-08:00","id":58245,"title":"","content":"My call is they cannot normally see them. They can see them when possessing their Geist (when they can see Spirits anyway) but not the rest of the time. So while all Bound can potentially see them, it is not free or passive.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/OnyxGraphics/OnyxMod.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Onyx Path Moderator </span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\">Forum Rules</a><br /> <span style=\"color:#FF0000\">This is my mod voice.</span> This is my goth voice.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/geist-the-sin-eaters/15731-geist-balance-of-shadows-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\">[Geist: Balance of Shadows</a><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/17537-v20-the-conspiracy-of-hrad-%C4%8Dern%C3%A1-hora-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\"> ][ Vampire: The Conspiracy of Hrad \u010cern\u00e1 Hora</a><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/13838-scion-bohemian-front-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\"> ][ Scion: Bohemian Front</a>][<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/99033-changeling-malibu-dream-house-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling: Malibu Dream House</a>] [<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/268069-demon-night-train-detective-agency-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\">Demon: Night Train Detective Agency</a>] <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/la94fvk\" target=\"_blank\">[WoD: The Golden Eagle</a>]","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/56-baroness-nerak","name":"Baroness Nerak","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar56_2.jpeg","title":"Moderator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2524"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-27T02:18:32-08:00","id":58593,"title":"","content":"Thank you all, that actually helped me alot","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1991-fallenxanderel","name":"FallenXanderel","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"25"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}